  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large skillet, cook the bacon over medium heat until crispy, then set aside.",
    "In the same skillet, cook the chopped onion until softened, then add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the beaten eggs, heavy cream, grated cheddar cheese, dried thyme, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the cooked onion and garlic mixture to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked bacon to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Pour the mixture into a 9x13 inch baking dish and bake for 35 minutes.",
    "Remove the dish from the oven and let it cool for 10 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
